        <mxCell id="tl_divergence" value="Not yet drawn on this page (RTL is authoritative):&#xa;- The iDMA data path is NOT an xbar initiator. soc_idma reaches soc_mem_ss ports 3/4 through its own soc_axi_to_mem instance; only its CSR leg (xbar -&gt; soc_axi_to_apb) uses the fabric. See the AXI Fabric page.&#xa;- The CVA6 leg passes through an axi_isolate stage on rst_ni, so a core-only reset cannot orphan a transaction the fabric accepted.&#xa;- soc_axi_to_mem is instantiated twice (xbar leg and iDMA leg) and is pipelined (MaxOutstanding)." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#b85450;fillColor=#f8cecc;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;spacing=6" parent="1" vertex="1">
