                <mxCell id="checker_note2" value="AXI protocol checkers (sim only):&#xa;- one soc_axi_protocol_checker on each core_axi_req[i] (xbar slave ports)&#xa;- one on each target_axi_req[i] (xbar master ports)&#xa;Single-beat invariants: len == 0, w.last == 1, payload stable while valid &amp;&amp; !ready.&#xa;&#xa;CVA6 mode (CoreType = CORE_CVA6): replaces RV32 instr/data OBI bridges with corejack_cva6_axi_adapter; AXI[1] is tied to &#39;0 (no second initiator)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;dashed=1" parent="1" vertex="1">
