                <mxCell id="dnote" value="Notes:&#xa;- DM register window comes back from the axi_xbar DEBUG master port (port[2]) via soc_axi_to_dm.&#xa;- DM SBA goes back into the AXI fabric as the third initiator (AXI[2]) for memory loads.&#xa;- ndmreset_ack is generated in soc_top after rstgen brings core_init_ni high again.&#xa;- debug_req and ndmreset are routed around the DM slave/SBA blocks via the left channel between dm_top and the slave/SBA blocks so they don&#39;t cross other blocks." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4" parent="1" vertex="1">
